OnBoardVN dataset — license summary

This dataset directory mixes content under different licenses, split by
top-level folder:

- facts/       CC0 1.0 Universal (Public Domain Dedication) — see
               facts/LICENSE-CC0.txt. Objective game facts (name, player
               count, playtime, age, categories, barcodes) created by
               OnBoardVN, dedicated to the public domain.
- admin-units/ MIT License — see admin-units/LICENSE-MIT.txt. Third-party
               Vietnamese province/ward data from
               ThangLeQuoc/vietnamese-provinces-database.
- descriptions/ CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).
               Original game descriptions written by OnBoardVN contributors.
- cafes/       CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).
               Café directory info collected from public sources
               (consentStatus=public_info_only entries omit lat/lng,
               sourceUrl and legacyDistrict from export, per
               apps/api/src/dataset/export.ts).

Source code for the OnBoardVN platform itself is licensed separately under
GNU AGPL-3.0-only (see repository root LICENSE) and is not part of this
dataset.
